{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"苏轼·core-contributions","stage":"DONE","category":"su-shi","categoryLabel":"苏轼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.85,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.33,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/26_su-shi/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"苏轼-核心贡献-简介\">苏轼·核心贡献 — 简介</h1><h2 id=\"本-hub-回答什么\">本 hub 回答什么</h2><p>苏轼（1037—1101）是中国文化史上罕见的旷世全才，在诗、词、文、书、画五个核心领域都进入第一流行列。本 hub 聚焦一个问题：<strong>苏轼到底做出了什么贡献、强在哪、为什么重要</strong>。它给出可核对的能力坐标，而非泛泛赞美——每篇都落到具体作品、年份、典范与权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-定位\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub（定位）</h2><p>苏轼条目共六个 hub，分工明确，请按需取用、避免在错的地方找内容：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>2·核心贡献（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>他做出了什么、强在哪</td>\n<td>成就本体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1·生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他经历了什么</td>\n<td>提供贡献的人生背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3·思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他凭什么思想做到的</td>\n<td>提供贡献的精神内核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4·主要作品</a></td>\n<td>单篇作品怎么读</td>\n<td>提供贡献的作品细读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5·影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>后世如何接受</td>\n<td>处理贡献的长远回响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6·争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>有哪些争议</td>\n<td>处理党争与评价分歧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本 hub 只讲&quot;成就本体&quot;，不重复展开人生际遇、思想体系、作品逐篇细读与后世接受——需要时通过相对链接跳转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节与推荐学习路径\">章节与推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[1·旷世全才&lt;br/&gt;全景与能力矩阵] --&gt; B[1·宋代文坛领袖&lt;br/&gt;历史角色]&#10;    B --&gt; C[2·豪放词的开创&lt;br/&gt;风格革新]&#10;    C --&gt; D[2·词境的拓展&lt;br/&gt;体制解放]&#10;    A --&gt; E[3·散文大家]&#10;    E --&gt; F[3·诗书画的成就]&#10;    D --&gt; G[融会贯通]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">flowchart LR\n    A[1·旷世全才&lt;br/&gt;全景与能力矩阵] --&gt; B[1·宋代文坛领袖&lt;br/&gt;历史角色]\n    B --&gt; C[2·豪放词的开创&lt;br/&gt;风格革新]\n    C --&gt; D[2·词境的拓展&lt;br/&gt;体制解放]\n    A --&gt; E[3·散文大家]\n    E --&gt; F[3·诗书画的成就]\n    D --&gt; G[融会贯通]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><p><strong>前置条件</strong>：无硬性前置，但先浏览 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 了解乌台诗案与贬谪黄州的背景，会更容易理解为何贬谪期反而是创作高峰。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐顺序</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"a-towering-man-of-letters/the-universal-genius\">旷世全才</a> — 先建立全景与能力矩阵（总入口）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"a-towering-man-of-letters/leader-of-song-letters\">宋代文坛领袖</a> — 理解其历史角色与苏门群体。</li>\n<li>词学线：<a href=\"transforming-ci-poetry/the-haofang-style\">豪放词的开创</a>（风格）→ <a href=\"transforming-ci-poetry/expanding-ci\">词境的拓展</a>（体制）。</li>\n<li>文艺线：<a href=\"prose-and-thought/master-of-prose\">散文大家</a> → <a href=\"prose-and-thought/the-eight-masters\">诗书画的成就</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>词学线与文艺线相互独立，可按兴趣调换先后。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适合读者\">适合读者</h2><p>希望系统理解苏轼文化贡献全貌的学习者；想分清&quot;成就 / 生平 / 思想 / 作品 / 影响 / 争议&quot;各自归属、避免混读的读者。每篇约 8–12KB，含具体年份、代表作与可核验来源，可单篇独立阅读。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-towering-man-of-letters","title":"A Towering Man Of Letters","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/a-towering-man-of-letters","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-universal-genius","title":"旷世全才","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/a-towering-man-of-letters/the-universal-genius"},{"seq":2,"slug":"leader-of-song-letters","title":"宋代文坛领袖","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/a-towering-man-of-letters/leader-of-song-letters"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"transforming-ci-poetry","title":"Transforming Ci Poetry","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/transforming-ci-poetry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-haofang-style","title":"豪放词的开创","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/transforming-ci-poetry/the-haofang-style"},{"seq":2,"slug":"expanding-ci","title":"词境的拓展","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/transforming-ci-poetry/expanding-ci"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"prose-and-thought","title":"Prose And Thought","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/prose-and-thought","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"master-of-prose","title":"散文大家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/prose-and-thought/master-of-prose"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-eight-masters","title":"诗书画的成就","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/prose-and-thought/the-eight-masters"}]}]}